Novel Style Distiller is a substantial rewrite of cangjie-skill:
https://github.com/kangarooking/cangjie-skill

Modified and renamed on 2026-08-13. The rewrite changes the domain from
long-form methodology distillation to novel-only plot, craft, prose-style,
tone, and narrative-voice distillation; it also replaces the extractors,
templates, evidence workflow, evaluation rules, and repository packaging.
The imported source snapshot did not include upstream Git history, so an exact
upstream commit identifier is not available in this repository.

